Newsgroups: misc.activism.progressive
From: Ron Buckmire <buckmr@rpi.edu>
Subject:  Highlights of the QUEER RESOURCES DIRECTORY
Message-ID: <1993May11.201339.8019@mont.cs.missouri.edu>
Date: Tue, 11 May 1993 20:13:39 GMT


		HIGHLIGHTS of the Queer Resources Directory [as of 5/10/93]

	* QRD is now listed in the Directory of WAIS Servers at quake.think.com

	* Brand New Hawaii directory for information on the recent gay
	 marriage ruling in /pub/QRD/qrd/rights/hawaii

	* /pub/QRD/CMS directory full of contacts, talking points
	  and background information from the CAMPAIGN FOR MILITARY SERVICE
	 about lifting the ban on gays, lesbians and bisexuals in the military

	* new directories for states where anti-gay initiatives are being filed
	currently colorado, idaho, oregon and washington, in /pub/QRD/qrd/rights

	* QRD is now available by Gopher at
	 teetot.acusd.edu, nifty.andrew.cmu.edu, windex.its.rpi.edu
	 hopper.acs.virginia.du and vector.intercon.com [WAIS capable]

	* Every single issue of AIDS TREATMENT NEWS from issue #142 1/3/92 on.
	/pub/QRD/qrd/aids/ATN-issue-*DATE*

	* Official quarterly AIDS statistics from 1st quarter 1992 on.
	/pub/QRD/qrd/aids/CDC-stats-*DATE*

	* Address and phone number for all 536 members of the 103nd Congress.
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/GOVT/congress-103

	* Address and phone number for all 535 members of the 102nd Congress.
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/GOVT/congress-102

	* list of companies and places that have non-discrimination ordinances
	  inclusive of sexual orientation
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/LISTS/non-discrim

	* Transcripts of articles on gay/lesbian/biexual/transgender issues
	  that appear in major newspapers.
	/pub/QRD/qrd/text

	* Transcripts of important legal opinions, such as Meinhold v D.O.D
	  and Bowers v Hardwick
	/pub/QRD/qrd/text

	* a list of over 200 movies with same-sex themes and addresses on how
	  you can order them
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/LISTS/glbo-films

	* a list of over 600 colleges with Queer student groups
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/LISTS/glb-campus.worldwide

	* a list of over 400 Queer Computer BBS's found all over the world
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/LISTS/glbMONTHYEAR.bbs

	* information about Queer groups and happenings all over the world
	/pub/QRD/qrd/world

	* list of companies and organisations that give domestic partner
	  benefits
	/pub/QRD/qrd/dp/list.orgs

	* the Resumes of all of President Clinton's Cabinet as well as contact
	  information for them
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info/GOVT/cabinet

	* Contact information for NGLTF, LLDEF, APLA, HRCF, GLAAD and numerous
	  other fun acronyms
	/pub/QRD/qrd/info

	* the newsletter of Los Angeles,New York and San Francisco Bay Area
           chapters of the Gay and Lesbian Alliance Against Defamation (GLAAD)
	/pub/QRD/qrd/glaad/glaad-LA-*DATE*
	/pub/QRD/qrd/glaad/glaad-NY-*DATE*
	/pub/QRD/qrd/glaad/glaad-SFBA-*DATE*

	* A compressed tar file containing all the contents of the QRD at the
	previous month's archiving /pub/QRD/qrd/qrd.DATE.tar.Z (about 4 MB)
	
	* and much, MUCH more!

For more information contact Ron Buckmire at <buckmr@RPI.EDU>
The QRD is found in /pub/QRD at vector.intercon.com (149.52.1.1.30)
The QRD is also found in /pub/QRD at nifty.andrew.cmu.edu (128.2.35.7).

